  "description": "Mass Yield presents Peanut Butter Gelato, a premium 1g pre-roll showcasing exceptional indica genetics. This convenient flower preroll delivers the distinctive characteristics indica enthusiasts seek—deep relaxation and soothing effects perfect for unwinding after a long day. Peanut Butter Gelato delights the senses with a rich, nutty aroma complemented by sweet, creamy undertones and subtle earthy notes. Each pre-roll is expertly crafted for consistent burn and smooth flavor delivery from start to finish. Whether you're seeking relief from daily stress or preparing for restful sleep, this strain's calming properties make it an ideal evening companion. Experience the quality and potency Mass Yield is known for in this ready-to-enjoy format—no grinding or rolling required. Simply light up and savor the relaxing journey this indica preroll provides.",
